msgid "BoardScribe"
msgstr "BoardScribe"

#. Description of the plugin
#: boardscribe.php
msgid "Publish accessible, searchable meeting agendas and minutes on your site — built for public bodies, HOAs, and nonprofits that need open, organized records."
msgstr "Cyhoeddwyr agendâu a chofnodion cyfarfodydd hygyrch y gellir chwilio drwyddynt ar eich safle — wedi'i adeiladu ar gyfer cyrff cyhoeddus, HOAs, a sefydliadau di-elw sydd angen cofnodion agored, trefnus."

#. Author of the plugin
